{"id":"203f765d44ea3c39","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-inner3-mouse-premouse.md","title":"ZFC Inner3 Mouse Premouse","display":"df-zfc-inner3-mouse-premouse — ZFC Inner3 Mouse Premouse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner3-mouse-premouse","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner3-mouse-premouse"],"display":"df-zfc-inner3-mouse-premouse — ZFC Inner3 Mouse Premouse","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner3-mouse-premouse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner3-mouse-premouse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner3-mouse-premouse — ZFC Inner3 Mouse Premouse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md\">../batch13/58-df-transitive.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0f1db95b853d761e\" href=\"?note=0f1db95b853d761e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md\">58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\vec E,X\\in V\">\\(M,\\vec E,X\\in V\\)</span> (premouse code, extender sequence, and underlying universe)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\)</span> (fine-structural premouse predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (see the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\\)</span> (bounded iterability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0f1db95b853d761e\" href=\"?note=0f1db95b853d761e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md\">58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MousePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MousePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}mouse\\text{-}premouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MousePremouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land\\exists X\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(M=\\langle X,\\in\\cap(X\\times X),\\vec E\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(X)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\to\n\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}mouse\\text{-}premouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MousePremouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land\\exists X\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(M=\\langle X,\\in\\cap(X\\times X),\\vec E\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(X)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\to\n\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The premouse code contains the set relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\\cap(X\\times X)\">\\(\\in\\cap(X\\times X)\\)</span>, not the ambient proper-class membership relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>; transitivity applies to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> rather than to the ordered tuple <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Full set-sized iterability is what upgrades the premouse to a mouse.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"0f1db95b853d761e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Premouse}_S$ (fine-structural premouse predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"0f1db95b853d761e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S$ (bounded iterability predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\vec E,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Transitive}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MousePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}mouse\\text{-}premouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MousePremouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land\\exists X\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(M=\\langle X,\\in\\cap(X\\times X),\\vec E\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(X)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\theta\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\to\n\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\in\\cap(X\\times X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"